== Gate tests added before the sabotages (a test gap found while designing SB10-b) ==
Without a supplied call PharmCAT makes no CYP2D6 call, so codeine is Unknown whatever the gates do: the negative
control alone cannot show the gates work. Two direct tests: (1) a real report with a supplied PM call, its CYP2D6
call relabelled callSource MATCHER (as research mode would make one): cpic_engine abstains; (2) build_response with a
report holding an OUTSIDE call but without this request's outside call: codeine Unknown, supplied_by null (the
eligibility layer). Both pass; each layer holds alone.

